## 9. 操作手册

**查健康（只读，安全）**
```bash
for u in 2ke-hub-mysql 2ke-dispatcher 2ke-wecom ruoyi-app nginx ruoyi-mysql ruoyi-redis; do
  echo "$u $(systemctl is-active $u) $(systemctl is-enabled $u)"; done
journalctl -u 2ke-dispatcher -n 20 --no-pager
curl -s -o /dev/null -w "%{http_code}\n" http://127.0.0.1:18081/system/tnotice/public/list
```

**重启单服务**
```bash
systemctl restart 2ke-hub-mysql   # 采集
systemctl restart 2ke-dispatcher  # 分发
systemctl restart ruoyi-app       # 后端
